<title>UK: Berlin Hannover Hypo sets 200 million mark bond.</title>
<headline>Berlin Hannover Hypo sets 200 million mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BERLIN HANNOVERISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.00	MATURITY    27.AUG.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.90    PAY DATE    27.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	LISTING    BERLIN    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NOTES     *TILL 27.AUG.97 THEN IF NOT CALLED AT PAR STEPS-UP TO</p>
<p>		4.75 PERCENT.</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	DENOMS (K) ONE	 GOV LAW     GERMAN</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 58</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
